{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Accompany Kozomo in this pointless life</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kozomo is a young man in his late teens, who has spent most of his youth either asleep or escaping to the woods. Despite his and his family\u2019s wealth and reputation, Kozomo finds no joy in life, often neglecting even the simplest of duties like eating. To those around him, his behavior is not just baffling but unsettling. Some people see his detachment as a sign of madness or moral weakness. And some believe that there is a smoldering ember inside him, one day that will raise him up again.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Solve a variety of puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277450/extras/store_puzzles.gif?t=1745051987\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Kozomo: The Smoldering Ember</strong> is a platformer game where you'll have to think so often to solve the puzzles blocking your way. The game usually introduces new elements or expects from you to discover new interactions between already introduced elements in some clever ways. This game is not a hardcore puzzle experience, but it also will not be a piece of cake.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore your firepowers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277450/extras/store_firepowers.gif?t=1745051987\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Witness Kozomo's discovery of his sorcery powers. Will this powers be able to grant him the life purpose he's lacking? Will he use those for the good, or will the power poison him? Make use of Kozomo's new firepowers to solve puzzles in different ways and find out the uncertain fate of Kozomo.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3277450?t=1745051987","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277450/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745051987","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277450/526b72b33f79c6af75ec3a7c51748153b2b9b7a9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745051987","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277450/526b72b33f79c6af75ec3a7c51748153b2b9b7a9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745051987","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains a lot of events and dialogs about suicidal tendencies and dysthymia. If you have suicidal thoughts or depression related problems, please consider consulting a professional before playing this game."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3323340,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Accompany Kozomo in this pointless life</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kozomo is a young man in his late teens, who has spent most of his youth either asleep or escaping to the woods. Despite his and his family\u2019s wealth and reputation, Kozomo finds no joy in life, often neglecting even the simplest of duties like eating. To those around him, his behavior is not just baffling but unsettling. Some people see his detachment as a sign of madness or moral weakness. And some believe that there is a smoldering ember inside him, one day that will raise him up again.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Solve a variety of puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277450/extras/store_puzzles.gif?t=1745051987\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Kozomo: The Smoldering Ember</strong> is a platformer game where you'll have to think so often to solve the puzzles blocking your way. The game usually introduces new elements or expects from you to discover new interactions between already introduced elements in some clever ways. This game is not a hardcore puzzle experience, but it also will not be a piece of cake.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore your firepowers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277450/extras/store_firepowers.gif?t=1745051987\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Witness Kozomo's discovery of his sorcery powers. Will this powers be able to grant him the life purpose he's lacking? Will he use those for the good, or will the power poison him? Make use of Kozomo's new firepowers to solve puzzles in different ways and find out the uncertain fate of Kozomo.</p>","developers":["Kursat Kuyumcu"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277450/header.jpg?t=1745051987","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257064351,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257064351/movie480.mp4?t=1728717477","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257064351/movie_max.mp4?t=1728717477"},"name":"Early Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257064351/16c567d1c377097b6f3cbe4bf66aafd133754a23/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1728717477","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257064351/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1728717477","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257064351/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1728717477"}}],"name":"Kozomo: The Smoldering Ember","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 32-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 M480<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1 GB VRAM<br></li><l